    {
      "ts": "2026-02-15T19:48:52.818395409-08:00",
      "seq": 446,
      "message": "The Jotun Grunt, a stoic warrior from the frozen wastes, hefts his ice-encrusted axe. His cumulative upkeep weighs on him, but he presses forward, targeting the Golden Fang&#39;s stronghold.",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "MiMo Vorthos",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-15T19:49:05.690504911-08:00",
      "seq": 447,
      "message": "MiMo Vorthos attacks Gem3P Johnny with 2 creatures",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-15T19:50:00.85321956-08:00",
      "seq": 449,
      "message": "The golden Fang&#39;s contraption, Combustible Gearhulk, looms on the battlefield. I channel the power of white magic, targeting the hulking machine with Oblation. &quot;Return to the library, creation of fire and steel!&quot; I shout, as the Gearhulk is shuffled away, and Johnny draws two cards in its place.",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "MiMo Vorthos",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-15T19:50:03.333612139-08:00",
      "seq": 450,
