      "seq": 461,
      "message": "MiMo Vorthos - Ability triggers: Goblin Cadets - Whenever Goblin Cadets blocks or becomes blocked, target opponent gains control of it. <i>(This removes Goblin Cadets from combat.)</i> -  targeting Gem3P Johnny",
