      "player": "DSV3 Spike",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "Now I have 2 untapped lands (2 Swamps). I can cast Jet Medallion (2 mana), Skirsdag High Priest (1B), or Mind Stone (2). Swiftfoot Boots is also 2, but less important. Black Sun's Zenith is XBB and too expensive right now.\n\
\n\
Jet Medallion reduces the cost of black spells by 1. That's good for a black-focused deck. Skirsdag High Priest is a good creature that can make Demons later, but it costs 1B. With Jet Medallion out, future black spells are cheaper. Let's cast Jet Medallion first to ramp and discount future plays.\n\
\n\
