      "result": "{\"cursor\":39900,\"log\":\"\\nGem3P Johnny - Ability triggers: Florian, Voldaren Scion - At the beginning of each of your postcombat main phases, look at the top X cards of your library, where X is the total amount of life your opponents lost this turn. Exile one of those cards and put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order. You may play the exiled card this turn.\\nGem3P Johnny turn 6 (37 - 39 - 39 - 27)\\nMiMo Vorthos - Ability triggers: Jotun Grunt - Cumulative upkeep\\u0026mdash;Put two cards from a single graveyard on the bottom of their owner\\u0027s library.\\nMiMo Vorthos puts Mountain from graveyard to the bottom of Gem3P Johnny\\u0027s library (source: Jotun Grunt)\\nMiMo Vorthos puts Swamp from graveyard to the bottom of Gem3F Stoic\\u0027s library (source: Jotun Grunt)\\nMiMo Vorthos puts Scattering Stroke from graveyard to the bottom of their library (source: Jotun Grunt)\\nMiMo Vorthos puts Shadowblood Ridge from graveyard to the bottom of Gem3P Johnny\\u0027s library (source: Jotun Grunt)\\nMiMo Vorthos draws a card\\nMiMo Vorthos - Ability triggers: Howling Mine - At the beginning of each player\\u0027s draw step, if Howling Mine is untapped, that player draws an additional card.\",\"truncated\":false,\"total_length\":39900}",
