\n\
Better to attack Johnny: He has no flying blockers. I can send Demon and Drana both flying at Johnny for 9 damage, putting him at 13. Gray Merchant ground might get blocked by Florian, but Florian is 3/3 vs Gray Merchant 2/4, trade. Skirsdag 1/2 ground can attack Vorthos? Might get blocked by Guard Gomazoa 1/3, trade. But I want to maximize damage to kill both.\n\
\n\
Actually, I can attack both players. I have 4 creatures. Let's attack Johnny with Demon and Drana (9 flying damage) and Gray Merchant ground (2 damage). That's 11 damage to Johnny, putting him at 11. Attack Vorthos with Skirsdag (1 damage). That's 1 damage to Vorthos, leaving him at 22.\n\
\n\
But Gray Merchant could get blocked by Florian, trade. I'd rather keep Gray Merchant alive for devotion and future Gray Merchant triggers. Maybe don't attack with Gray Merchant. Attack Johnny with Demon and Drana only (9 damage). Attack Vorthos with Skirsdag (1 damage). That's okay.\n\
\n\
But I also have Swiftfoot Boots, could equip to Drana for hexproof/haste, but that costs 1, can't do now.\n\
\n\
Let's just attack all-out: Demon and Drana at Johnny, Gray Merchant and Skirsdag at Vorthos. Gray Merchant 2/4 vs Windborn Muse 2/3? Windborn Muse can block flying, but Gray Merchant is ground. Actually Windborn Muse is flying, can't block ground? Wait, flying creatures can block ground creatures? Yes, flying creatures can block ground creatures unless they have reach or something. Windborn Muse has flying, can block ground. So Gray Merchant can be blocked by Windborn Muse. That's 2/4 vs 2/3, trade maybe? Windborn Muse dies, Gray Merchant survives with 1 damage? Actually 2/4 vs 2/3, both deal damage equal to power, Windborn Muse deals 2 to Gray Merchant, Gray Merchant deals 2 to Windborn Muse, Windborn Muse dies, Gray Merchant takes 2 damage, becomes 2/2? Wait, damage doesn't reduce toughness, it's marked damage. Gray Merchant would have 2 damage marked, still 4 toughness, survives. So Gray Merchant lives.\n\
\n\
Skirsdag attacks Vorthos, can be blocked by Guard Gomazoa (1/3). Skirsdag 1/2 vs Guard Gomazoa 1/3, Skirsdag dies, Guard Gomazoa takes 1 damage, lives.\n\
