Wait, `pass_priority(until=\"my_turn\")` is risky if I want to play sorcery speed stuff in second main.\n\
But I assumed I would get priority after the Florian trigger resolved.\n\
The system says \"pending_action_from_choose_action\".\n\
Actually, the last `pass_priority` call returned \"action_pending: true, action_type: GAME_TARGET, choices: Discard ...\".\n\
This means I am discarding to hand size (8 cards -> 7).\n\
So I missed casting Rakdos! Disaster.\n\
That's unfortunate. I must discard a card now.\n\
I have:\n\
1. Falkenrath Noble {3}{B}\n\
2. Nightshade Harvester {3}{B}\n\
3. Rakdos, Lord of Riots {B}{B}{R}{R}\n\
4. Bedevil {B}{B}{R}\n\
5. Chaos Warp {2}{R}\n\
6. Blackcleave Cliffs (Land) - Keep! I need lands.\n\
7. Morbid Opportunist {2}{B}\n\
8. Syr Konrad {3}{B}{B}\n\
\n\
I have 8 cards. Max hand size is 7. Discard 1.\n\
I missed casting Rakdos, so he is still in hand.\n\
Next turn I will have 9 mana (hopefully with land drop).\n\
I can cast Rakdos next turn if I damage someone. Or Syr Konrad.\n\
Syr Konrad is expensive ({5}).\n\
Rakdos is hard to cast ({B}{B}{R}{R}).\n\
Nightshade Harvester is mediocre unless I drop lands on opponents' turns? No, it triggers on *their* land drops. It's a 3/2 or 2/2? No, {3}{B} 2/2. Probably weak compared to others.\n\
Falkenrath Noble is good aristocrats payoff.\n\
Morbid Opportunist is draw engine. (Wait, I cast him earlier! No wait, I tried to cast him in the mana plan that failed?)\n\
Ah, my previous turn attempt with Rakdos failed.\n\
So I have all these cards.\n\
I will discard **Nightshade Harvester**. It's the weakest card here.\n\
Or maybe **Falkenrath Noble** if I'm not sacrificing much.\n\
Harvester drains life and grows. Noble drains life when stuff dies.\n\
Syr Konrad does both better.\n\
Bedevil is crucial removal. Chaos Warp is crucial removal.\n\
Rakdos is my commander/bomb.\n\
Konrad is bomb.\n\
Opportunist is draw.\n\
Land is land.\n\
\n\
So it's between Noble and Harvester.\n\
Noble is a flier (2/2 flying). Harvester is ground (2/2, grows).\n\
Harvester punishes ramp. Turn 10? Maybe less landfall happening.\n\
Noble triggers on ANY creature death.\n\
I'll discard **Nightshade Harvester**.\n\
\n\
Wait, did I really miss casting Rakdos?\n\
Yes, `T9 Postcombat Main` -> `T9 End/Cleanup`.\n\
My previous `pass_priority` had `until=\"my_turn\"`. This skips everything until my next turn.\n\
BUT it stopped for the Florian trigger (a non-priority action/choice).\n\
After I made the choice for Florian (Talisman), the `until=\"my_turn\"` resumed skipping!\n\
That was my mistake. I should have used `until=\"stack_resolved\"` or just `pass_priority()` if I wanted to act after resolving the trigger in Postcombat Main.\n\
Lesson learned: Do not use `until=\"my_turn\"` if you have things to do in the current turn's later phases (like postcombat main).\n\
\n\
Okay, discarding Nightshade Harvester.\n\
\n\
