      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "Now Shriekmaw resolved, Rapacious One died. I have morbid now. I can activate Skirsdag High Priest's morbid ability: Tap two untapped creatures you control, create a 5/5 Demon token with flying. I have many creatures.\n\
