      "player": "DSV3 Spike",
      "decision_index": 70,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "DSV3 Spike has 5 lands (including Jet Medallion for cost reduction) and Mind Stone in hand, but chose to pass without playing anything. Mind Stone costs 2 mana and would provide ramp for the expensive cards in hand (Drana at 5 mana, Evernight Shade at 4 mana, Skeletal Scrying). With only 4 lands producing mana plus Jet Medallion, deploying Mind Stone accelerates toward casting Drana or Syr Konrad-level threats a turn earlier. Swiftfoot Boots (also 2 mana) could also be deployed to protect a future Drana. There's no reason to hold mana open with no instants worth casting at this point in the game (Skeletal Scrying with X=0 is useless, and Black Sun's Zenith for X=0 or X=1 isn't needed yet).",
      "action_taken": "Passed without casting any spells, leaving mana unused.",
      "better_line": "Cast Mind Stone (2 mana) to ramp toward Drana or Evernight Shade next turn, or cast Swiftfoot Boots to prepare for protecting Drana when she comes down.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 70,
