      "decision_index": 208,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "During the combat phase (likely an opponent's end step or similar timing window), Gem3F Stoic declined to activate Sensei's Divining Top to look at the top 3 cards of their library. This is a free information advantage that should almost always be used when mana is available, especially before their own draw step with Sylvan Library on the battlefield. Knowing the top 3 cards helps make optimal Sylvan Library decisions. They have an untapped Snow-Covered Island and other untapped lands to pay the {1} activation cost.",
      "action_taken": "Passed without activating any abilities during combat.",
      "better_line": "Activate Sensei's Divining Top for {1} to look at the top 3 cards and arrange them optimally, especially important with Sylvan Library in play to plan the upcoming draw step.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 190,
