    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Failed to activate Sensei's Divining Top before Sylvan Library trigger resolves. The Top + Sylvan Library combo is one of the most powerful synergies in Magic: tap Top to draw a card (putting Top on top of library), then Sylvan Library draws Top + another card. Since Top was 'drawn this turn,' you put Top back on top of your library as one of the two cards, effectively drawing an extra card every turn for free with no life payment.",
      "action_taken": "Declined to activate any abilities with Sylvan Library trigger on the stack.",
