      "description": "Gem3F Stoic passed on activating Creeping Tar Pit during their own combat phase to deal 3 unblockable damage. With 6 untapped lands, activating Tar Pit (1UB) would leave 3 lands untapped - enough to hold up Miscalculation (1U) though not Cryptic Command (1UUU). In a multiplayer game at 19 life with strong control cards in hand, the trade-off between 3 unblockable damage and keeping Cryptic Command mana open is debatable.",
