    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "When resolving Jotun Grunt's upkeep trigger to put two cards from a single graveyard on the bottom of their owner's library, MiMo chose to tuck Tolaria West instead of Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth from Gem3F Stoic's graveyard. Urborg is a much more impactful card - it turns all lands into Swamps, enabling powerful mana fixing especially for black-heavy strategies. Tolaria West is useful but less game-warping.",
