    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Liliana's Reaver is a reasonable threat, but Drana, Kalastria Bloodchief is likely stronger in this position. Drana is a 4/4 flyer (better evasion than fear since Florian is black and can block Reaver) and her activated ability serves as repeatable removal that can handle Florian or other threats. With opponents at 22 life each and DSV3 at 72, the game isn't about racing - it's about board control, where Drana excels.",
