    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "DSV3 Spike chose to bottom Pestilence Demon and keep Sol Ring on top during the Read the Bones scry. While Sol Ring is excellent, the player already has 8 mana sources on board (including Jet Medallion for black cost reduction and Mind Stone). Sol Ring's impact is diminished at this stage of the game. Pestilence Demon, on the other hand, is a 7/6 flyer that deals 1 damage to each creature and player for {B} each activation - this is extremely powerful with the player at 72 life, especially as a board control tool and win condition. With Jet Medallion reducing the cost, Pestilence Demon would cost 7 generic + 1 black (effectively 7 total with medallion), which is castable soon. The player is drawing 2 cards after scry anyway, so they could have bottomed Sol Ring and kept Pestilence Demon on top to draw it immediately.",
